You do not need another tracking variable.

price_key is meant to change depending on what the frontend sends.

The key point is:

price_key = "standard"

does not match "double".

It only selects "standard".

In our practice questions, we manually wrote:

price_key = "standard"

because we were pretending the customer selected standard.

In the real FastAPI endpoint, the value comes from the frontend:

price_key = request.price_key